---
description: Vector testing rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Prioritize tests for tenant isolation, authorization, consent, suppression, attribution, provider idempotency, AI action policy, creative rights or generation isolation, lead-stage transitions, revenue isolation, entitlement deny, and attribution-confidence labels.
Also test hostname-to-tenant routing, preview isolation, and launch-time cross-tenant leakage.
Use bun:test. Do not claim a feature is complete if required tests were not executed.
Any bug involving cross tenant access requires a regression test.
